#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:13
#: 44c2f64295a844b983be57f3aa3b3f42
msgid ""
"A :term:`disposable template <disposable template>` is not a disposable qube "
"in itself, but a qube that can be used to create different disposable types: "
"normal :term:`disposables <disposable>` and :term:`named disposables <named "
"disposable>`. This intermediary template serves different functions: first, "
"it allows customization of the private volume of a disposable, and second, "
"it provides a degree of inheritance that would not be possible with normal "
"templates. It has the :py:attr:`~core-admin:qubes.vm.mix.dvmtemplate."
"DVMTemplateMixin.template_for_dispvms` property enabled, being a :py:class:"
"`~core-admin:qubes.vm.mix.dvmtemplate.DVMTemplateMixin`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:15
#: 73c04682be3346f686474f0a8eea4176
msgid ""
"A :term:`disposable` is a qube with the :py:class:`~core-admin:qubes.vm."
"dispvm.DispVM` class and is based on a disposable template. Every disposable "
"type has all of its volumes configured to disable :py:attr:`~core-admin:"
"qubes.storage.Volume.save_on_stop`, therefore no changes are saved on "
"shutdown. Normal disposables enable the property :py:attr:`~core-admin:qubes."
"vm.dispvm.DispVM.auto_cleanup` by default, thus Qubes OS automatically "
"removes the qube upon shutdown. Named disposables don't enable :py:attr:"
"`~core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm.DispVM.auto_cleanup` by default, thus the qube "
"skeleton is not removed upon shutdown, thus allowing to keep qube settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:17
#: fa1164592ddc485792dfdf8db7f31020
msgid ""
"Named disposables are useful for service qubes, as referencing static names "
"is easier when the qube name is mentioned on qrexec policies (:file:`qubes."
"UpdatesProxy` target) or as a property of another qube, such as a "
"disposable :term:`net qube` which is referenced by downstream clients in the "
"``netvm`` property."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:19
#: 3960da70c0cf49288b1f6274c1ded8da
msgid ""
"Disposables are generally named according to the :samp:`disp{1234}` scheme, "
"where :samp:`{1234}` is derived from the :py:attr:`~core-admin:qubes.vm."
"dispvm.DispVM.dispid` property, a random integer ranging from 0 to 9999 with "
"a fail-safe mechanism to avoid reusing the same value in a short period. "
"Named disposables have a user-set permanent name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:23
#: 38f9551a1613429f9c64ae2945481373
msgid "Creating disposables through qrexec"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:25
#: 5f1e7ddc8e9c401da97119874c8b4a16
msgid ""
"Every qube has the :py:attr:`~core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm.DispVM."
"default_dispvm` property, which defines which disposable template will be "
"used to spawn disposables for this qube by default (when using actions such "
"as \"open in disposable\"). It can have one of three values:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:28
#: 01b9bbc954f247c5abacf92d11bbb2e9
msgid "a disposable template"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:29
#: 55767dd3e6d64902a4022aab089af6f1
msgid "empty value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:30
#: 5ca6cd9a298643ee9ea5a9d1de0c155e
msgid ""
"default system value (this will use the system-wide :py:attr:`~core-admin:"
"qubes.vm.dispvm.DispVM.default_dispvm` property)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:32
#: 2f3418d48b5e4694a9a90fb396766a56
msgid ""
"In case of disposables, this property is by default set to their own "
"disposable template, to avoid data leaks through, for example, using "
"unintended network access paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:34
#: 73fa21a911ce4b0d99b9f6723e4acb7c
msgid ""
"This value is also used in case of qrexec policy: when policy rules use the :"
"doc:`@dispvm <core-qrexec:qrexec-policy>` tag, it translates to \"a "
"disposable based on the source qube's :py:attr:`~core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm."
"DispVM.default_dispvm`. It is most commonly used to open files and URLs, (:"
"file:`qubes.OpenInVM` and :file:`qubes.OpenURL`, respectively)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:36
#: fcfe290c2aa943308d054d17f9f89e60
msgid ""
"If you want to allow creating disposables based on different disposable "
"templates, you can use the disposable template name or tag as destination. "
"In particular:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:38
#: d8e72705813a490db39cd64a86ad112e
msgid ""
":samp:`@dispvm:{DISPOSABLE_TEMPLATE}`, where :samp:`{DISPOSABLE_TEMPLATE}` "
"is the desired template;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:39
#: 665acb41ab1644bfad49c3b4dddbb32d
msgid ""
":samp:`@dispvm:@tag:{CUSTOM_TAG}`, where :samp:`{CUSTOM_TAG}` is the tag of "
"your choice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:42
#: 5198cb4c7a274bacb15e0873a7d107c4
msgid "Preloaded disposables"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:45
#: d1e9e52803e5434e8193266c2d26aa02
msgid ""
"Starting new disposables can be a slow process. To speed it up, Qubes OS "
"provides disposable preloading, which enables fast retrieval of fresh "
"disposables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:47
#: 23a313d05b2045c8bc575576157b50c4
msgid ""
"Instead of performing the whole startup each time a new :term:`disposable` "
"is requested, preloading keeps prepared (running and paused) qubes in the "
"background, ready to be used when needed. In order to accomplish this, they "
"are started in the background without user interaction, hidden from most "
"graphical applications by being :term:`internal <internal qube>`. They are "
"unpaused (transparently) when a disposable qube is requested by the user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:50
#: a441063c01d94112b670d7809e9bfb4c
msgid "Preloaded disposable's stages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:52
#: e2384f424269416ab69413e6bcdf57ca
msgid ""
"There are several stages a disposable goes through when preloading is "
"enabled:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:54
#: de511622f5d14c61b1acb863a5597f5a
msgid ""
"**Preload**: The qube is created and marked as preloaded. The qube is not "
"visible in GUI applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:56
#: c0a1efb2ba66457ba176c1d7259642c8
msgid ""
"**Startup**: Begins qube startup, starts basic services and attempts to "
"pause the qube."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:58
#: 10d9ae7d7bb84eec8c064bdf61001142
msgid ""
"**Request**: Triggered by the user requesting a new disposable qube. The "
"qube is removed from the preload list. If qube startup has not yet reached "
"pause, the pause stage is skipped."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:60
#: 8aa72802ea714050b534438433ac7446
msgid ""
"**Used**: The qube is marked as used and will be unpaused/resumed (if "
"needed). At this stage, GUI applications treat the qube as any other "
"disposable and the qube object is returned to the caller if requested."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:63
#: ffb95a4c26ea41239aeaf12b1a44a8ca
msgid "Preloaded disposable's worry-free life-cycle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:66
#: 76dfff0580f04063adec6de88a81da5d
msgid ""
"There are several events that may trigger the creation or deletion of "
"preloaded disposables. Qubes OS attempts to maintain as many preloaded "
"disposables as the user set through the ``preload-dispvm-max`` feature, and "
"any preloaded disposables that are invalid will be deleted or replaced as "
"soon as possible. This is balanced by the need to ensure the system is "
"responsive, thus the refreshing of disposables may take some time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:70
#: 8d14c54e8870429f94deb8bf175fdb18
msgid "Preloaded disposable's management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:72
#: b4c794d1fcc74ae98f3bb5355c488ae4
msgid ""
"Maximum number of preloaded disposables is defined by the ``preload-dispvm-"
"max`` feature. This feature can be set on any disposable template (this "
"defines the maximum number of disposables preloaded from this template), and "
"on the ``dom0`` (this defines the maximum number of disposables preloaded "
"from the system-wide default disposable template). In case those values "
"conflict, the ``dom0`` value takes precedence (for example, if ``preload-"
"dispvm-max`` is set to 0 on the ``default-dvm`` disposable template, which "
"is the default disposable template, and to 4 on ``dom0``, Qubes OS will "
"attempt to preload 4 disposables from ``default-dvm``)."
msgstr ""

