#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:110
#: 92f1bf86691d4ff8bf9ee03f17d3140c
msgid "Preloaded disposables' memory management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:113
#: 915df334077e4e1c89022e64ff239853
msgid ""
"Qubes OS attempts to manage a preloaded disposable's qube memory directly "
"before the pause stage, as it is impossible to negotiate memory with a "
"paused qube. At the :py:meth:`domain-pre-paused <core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm."
"DispVM.on_domain_pre_paused>` stage, memory is set to use preferred memory "
"value. In :doc:`qmemman terms </developer/services/qmemman>`, preferred "
"memory is just enough to have the qube running, and so, hopefully as much as "
"possible of qube memory is retrieved to be used by other, currently running "
"qubes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:115
#: 49a414312b1d46599758597a56a9ff39
msgid ""
"This process can take a bit of time because it depends on how fast the qube "
"can free up memory. In ``qubes.qmemman.systemstate``, there is a timeout "
"(``CHECK_PERIOD``) and a threshold in transfer speed (``CHECK_MB_S``) when "
"attempting to balloon. When both of these conditions are met, the memory "
"management is done and the preloaded disposable can be paused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:117
#: 6fee97ef69484703a40d5cfedae574a1
msgid ""
"We do not worry about the time this process takes, even though it does "
"prolong the preload creation stage. In the long run, the memory usage is "
"more important. Unfortunately, qmemman is synchronous, so only one request "
"can be made at a time, thus anything that takes too much time on qmemman "
"could prevent balancing memory usage of other qubes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:120
#: 96cd94545cc2404581536802d8066ca4
msgid "Preloaded disposable's pause"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:122
#: 19bcac31ca414b41aab0a29f7990e660
msgid "Preloaded disposables are paused because:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:124
#: e7e50427ddd04ac9b7c0ff10229c7fa4
msgid ""
"it makes detecting if a qube was used without being requested with :py:meth:"
"`core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm.DispVM.from_appvm`. Not every communication with "
"a qube goes through :program:`qubesd`, it may happen via qrexec or GUI "
"daemon;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:125
#: a5045dafbbc7435cbd574fa06a3fd5fe
msgid "CPU scheduling economy: a paused domain is not eligible for it;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:126
#: d0a1959a7279479aa8fb66727da8f2ba
msgid ""
"Cronjob, timers and other things that don't block the init system and "
"service manager completion won't run and alter a clean state."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:128
#: d5d04dcb3d2e453995602b14a222d4b5
msgid "But this comes at a cost:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:130
#: 67924196812f4927bf549bde86843c8b
msgid ""
"Memory management before pause may take some seconds. As described above, "
"this does not increase time to use the preloaded qube but can slow down the "
"system as a whole, as :doc:`qmemman </developer/services/qmemman>` can not "
"balance memory usage of other qubes in the mean time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:133
#: ed8558ca793645f681778e7c55065610
msgid "Preloaded disposable's security"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:136
#: 8137ae33e70c41f18ee18171e201ae73
msgid ""
"As preloaded disposables are started before being used, some measures to "
"prevent accidental tampering and reuse were introduced:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:138
#: 656cf4725e8b4d0aa6044361ef3026ad
msgid ""
"The qube has the ``internal`` feature enabled. Qubes GUI applications hide :"
"term:`internal qubes<internal qube>`;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:139
#: 82a9ea12ca69429bbdd664ffa3c078c7
msgid ""
"When requesting a disposable, the qube object is only returned to the user "
"once it has finished preloading;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:140
#: 30afbb2d1f604b3a83ba6e5057a2962f
msgid ""
"The qube is paused as the last stage of preloading. This means the :py:meth:"
"`domain-unpaused <core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm.DispVM.on_domain_unpaused>` "
"event  can be used to mark the qube as used and remove it from the preload "
"list, avoiding reliabce on :py:meth:`core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm.DispVM."
"from_appvm`;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:141
#: 31aad5f7f97b4a988ab774f3deae6fd8
msgid ""
"The GUID and Audio daemon only connect to the GUI agent and audio agent in "
"the qube after the preloaded disposable is marked as used. This prevents "
"autostarted applications from appearing on the screen before they are ready "
"or before pause, which could be confusing. Enabling a GUI is controlled by "
"the :py:attr:`~core-admin:qubes.vm.dispvm.DispVM.is_preload` property - when "
"it is set to False, GUI and audio connections are initiated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:143
#: 21eed8db4392400882f3b6b00399853b
msgid "To ensure reliability:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:145
#: 571c43834718479a841c50092c9ab037
msgid ""
"The ``preload-dispvm-threshold`` feature controls how much free memory must "
"be present on the system before attempting to create a new preloaded "
"disposable. Used to ensure preloaded disposables do not consume all "
"available memory, which would prevent starting other qubes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/disposablevm-implementation.rst:147
#: e2439cea5bc946769f72bb48e9c01a0c
msgid ""
"To have late GUI daemon but an early GUI agent, changes have been made that "
"limit the usability on ``sys-gui``. `Events such as plugging or removing "
"external monitors can't work, it will be ignored by Xephyr <https://github."
"com/QubesOS/qubes-gui-agent-linux/pull/253>`__."
msgstr ""

